s and skip already-processed items on retry:\n\n```python\nprocessed = set(load_processed_ids())  # restore from prior run\nfor page in pages:\n    for item in page.items:\n        if item.id in processed:\n            continue\n        client.push(item, token=token)\n        processed.add(item.id)\n        checkpoint(item.id)\n```\n\nThe first approach is simpler if your checkpoint storage is cheap (usually is).","ttft_ms":3799,"ttft_stream_ms":1096,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duration_ms":6959,"uuid":"a3da2e9d-2ec3-4512-9abd-30f8582b2e75"}
